You are acting as a Principal Software Architect, DevSecOps Engineer, Cloud Infrastructure Engineer, and Senior Full-Stack Engineer.

We need to prepare the current Qguard Helix codebase for its Phase 1 MVP Production Deployment.

IMPORTANT:
Do NOT blindly rewrite, replace, delete, or restructure the application.

The primary objective is to reorganize and harden the existing codebase so that it can be deployed reliably to production while preserving all existing functionality, features, business logic, security controls, data flows, API contracts, UI flows, authentication, database behavior, and integrations.

The architecture must also provide a clean foundation for future enterprise-scale enhancements.

